1
00:00:03,63 --> 00:00:09,40
你好，我是菲比布非 我底下有寶寶要出來
I'm Phoebe Buffay,and I have babies coming out.

3
00:00:09,40 --> 00:00:11,87
Have you started having contractions?
好，你開始陣痛了嗎？

4
00:00:12,07 --> 00:00:14,94
Not yet. I heard they really hurt. Do they?
還沒，聽說會很痛，真的嗎？

5
00:00:16,28 --> 00:00:17,68
Oh,my God!
這麼嘛… 天哪

6
00:00:18,85 --> 00:00:20,34
Which of you is the father?
哪一位是父親？

7
00:00:20,58 --> 00:00:23,57
None of them are. The father is my brother.
他們都不是，我弟才是

8
00:00:24,72 --> 00:00:25,98
好

9
00:00:26,42 --> 00:00:29,69
I'll miss watching you freak people out like that.
我一定會很懷念你那樣嚇別人

10
00:00:31,49 --> 00:00:34,09
This is for the babies to look at someday.
菲比，快，這是要給寶寶看的

11
00:00:34,30 --> 00:00:36,96
Do you want to say anything before it starts?
在生產前你有話要說嗎？ 好

12
00:00:38,67 --> 00:00:41,97
Hi,kids! It's me,Aunt Phoebe.
孩子們，我是菲比姑姑 

13
00:00:42,27 --> 00:00:45,33
Can't wait to see you. Please don't hurt me!
真想趕快見到你們 請不要弄痛我

15
00:00:48,11 --> 00:00:49,54
What took you so long?
你們怎麼那麼慢？ 

16
00:00:49,78 --> 00:00:51,97
Your cab left when ours did.
兩輛車是一起出發的

17
00:00:55,78 --> 00:00:58,48
We went back because I forgot my jacket.
我們回去拿我的外套

18
00:00:58,52 --> 00:00:58,89
沒錯

19
00:01:03,49 --> 00:01:04,98
You're not wearing one.
你沒穿外套啊

20
00:01:05,83 --> 00:01:08,32
Oh,man! I did it again!
真是的，我又忘了

21
00:01:09,73 --> 00:01:12,00
Someone has to call Frank and Alice.
得有人通知法蘭克和愛麗絲

22
00:01:12,23 --> 00:01:14,46
My mom might What are you doing?
我媽也想…喬伊，你幹什麼？

23
00:01:14,67 --> 00:01:16,80
I've got to get the "before" shot!
我得拍生產前的鏡頭

24
00:01:18,51 --> 00:01:20,80
The One With The Triplets AKA The One Hundredth
本集播出：「生產記」

25
00:01:20,91 --> 00:01:22,50
<font color=#38B0DE>rainystar壓制ipod-mp4</font>

26
00:02:08,26 --> 00:02:12,12
We spoke to the nurse. The reason your doctor is late...
我們問過護士了 你的醫生之所以遲到是因為

28
00:02:12,33 --> 00:02:14,39
...is because she's not coming.
她不來了

29
00:02:15,40 --> 00:02:17,56
She hit her head in the shower.
什麼？ 她在浴室跌倒撞到頭

30
00:02:18,23 --> 00:02:21,23
Oh,my God. She's so stupid!
天哪，那個蠢女人

31
00:02:21,67 --> 00:02:23,53
Phoebe,it's gonna be okay.
菲比，不會有事的

32
00:02:23,74 --> 00:02:27,54
I don't see three kids coming out of your vagina!
你說得輕鬆 你的陰道又沒有寶寶要出來

33
00:02:31,08 --> 00:02:34,21
Listen. The nurse said the doctor is wonderful.
聽著，護士說這個醫生很好 

34
00:02:34,42 --> 00:02:36,28
He's head of the department.
對，他是婦產科主任

35
00:02:36,52 --> 00:02:39,08
All right. Oh,dear God,save me!
老天爺救救我 怎麼了？

36
00:02:39,35 --> 00:02:41,45
I'm having my first contraction!
第一次陣痛來了

37
00:02:42,22 --> 00:02:43,71
Oh,it's not bad.
還好嘛 好

38
00:02:46,09 --> 00:02:50,43
And so the miracle of birth begins. And l
生命的奇跡開始了…

39
00:02:50,70 --> 00:02:51,69
You okay?
你沒事吧？

40
00:02:52,97 --> 00:02:54,03
Something hurts.
有個地方好痛

41
00:02:54,24 --> 00:02:57,10
It's sympathy pains. That's so sweet!
是感同身受，好感人喔

42
00:02:57,77 --> 00:02:59,64
I didn't know I cared that much.
我不知道我有那麼在意

43
00:03:03,95 --> 00:03:07,57
I'm Dr. Harad. I'll be delivering your babies.
我是哈洛醫生 我負責替你接生

46
00:03:07,78 --> 00:03:11,12
You'll be in good hands. I've been doing this a long time.
有我在你放心，我是老手了

47
00:03:11,39 --> 00:03:13,75
I'll be back to do your internal.
我馬上回來幫你做檢查

48
00:03:13,96 --> 00:03:16,15
Just relax,everything looks great.
你先放輕鬆，目前一切都很好

49
00:03:16,39 --> 00:03:18,99
And also,I love Fonzie.
還有，我愛方奇

50
00:03:22,30 --> 00:03:24,82
Did he just say he loves Fonzie?
他剛才說他愛方奇嗎？ 

51
00:03:25,10 --> 00:03:26,90
That's what it sounded like.
聽起來是

52
00:03:27,67 --> 00:03:28,76
All right.
好

53
00:03:33,01 --> 00:03:36,14
Am I late? Nobody came out yet,right?
我來晚了嗎？ 還沒有人出來吧？

54
00:03:36,51 --> 00:03:39,14
No,we haven't started yet. Where's Alice?
沒有，還沒開始呢 愛麗絲呢？

55
00:03:39,35 --> 00:03:42,78
Delaware. Until she gets here, I'll be your coach.
在德拉威，不過她正在趕來 目前先由我充當教練

56
00:03:43,02 --> 00:03:45,99
Don't worry. She told me about the LaMazda stuff.
放心，她有教我拉馬茲什麼的

57
00:03:46,85 --> 00:03:49,41
If you get the babies out by month's end...
就是在月底前生產 

58
00:03:49,62 --> 00:03:51,49
...you get two percent financing.
就能獲得2%的補助

59
00:03:52,39 --> 00:03:53,72
對

60
00:03:56,80 --> 00:03:59,36
Monica,you're gonna be very proud of me.
摩妮卡，你一定會很以我為榮 

61
00:03:59,60 --> 00:04:03,16
I just got us dates with two unbelievably cute nurses.
我幫我們約到兩個俏護士

62
00:04:03,37 --> 00:04:04,77
Oh,my!
喔

63
00:04:06,14 --> 00:04:07,94
They're male nurses.
是男看護 

64
00:04:08,44 --> 00:04:10,10
Not in my head.
在我想像中不是

65
00:04:10,81 --> 00:04:14,84
They want to take us out Saturday night! What do you say?
總之他們約我們週六晚上出去 如何？

66
00:04:20,15 --> 00:04:21,55
I don't think so.
我看算了

67
00:04:22,39 --> 00:04:23,86
What are you talking about?
什麼？什麼叫算了？

68
00:04:24,13 --> 00:04:27,86
You've been telling me to get over Ross and move on.
是你勸我忘記羅斯向前看的

69
00:04:28,06 --> 00:04:30,16
I'm moving on and so are you.
我向前看了，你得陪我 

70
00:04:30,37 --> 00:04:31,86
Why don't you want to go?
你說，你為什麼不去

71
00:04:34,34 --> 00:04:36,90
Why don't you give me a good reason...
不如你說一個理由 

72
00:04:37,14 --> 00:04:39,47
...and I'll tell you if it's true.
我再告訴你是對是錯

73
00:04:41,18 --> 00:04:44,08
-What? -Harder than it sounds,isn't it?
什麼？ 沒那麼簡單吧

74
00:04:44,75 --> 00:04:47,21
You're coming. And when they get off...
總之你也要去 

75
00:04:47,52 --> 00:04:49,75
...we'll go get some Jello with them.
我還答應他們下班一起吃果凍

76
00:04:50,82 --> 00:04:53,51
There's always room for Jello.
沒錯，人永遠吃得下果凍

77
00:04:56,99 --> 00:04:58,93
How do you make that dirty?
你為什麼能說得那麼色？

78
00:04:59,16 --> 00:05:01,72
It's easy. I can do it with anything.
簡單，我什麼都能說得很色 你聽

79
00:05:02,70 --> 00:05:05,53
Grandma's chicken salad....
奶奶的雞肉沙拉…

80
00:05:15,01 --> 00:05:16,84
Get a shot of this.
羅斯，拍這裡

81
00:05:17,55 --> 00:05:20,34
These are the headlines when you were born.
寶寶們 這是你們出生當天的頭條

82
00:05:20,55 --> 00:05:24,28
Now,girl baby,turn away. And boy babies...
女寶寶把頭轉開，男寶寶…

83
00:05:24,55 --> 00:05:26,21
...check it out!
看，

84
00:05:27,09 --> 00:05:29,61
This is what naked women looked like when you were born.
這就是你出生當月的裸女

85
00:05:29,86 --> 00:05:32,45
Now let's dive into the good stuff.
盡情欣賞吧

86
00:05:33,90 --> 00:05:36,42
Okay,I'm having another one!
好，陣痛又來了

87
00:05:36,63 --> 00:05:39,57
This one doesn't hurt eith Yes,it does!
這次也不太痛…錯，很痛

88
00:05:45,31 --> 00:05:47,30
I was kind of hoping that was it.
我有點希望已經生了

89
00:05:50,04 --> 00:05:52,27
Where are Monica and Rachel,anyway?
摩妮卡和瑞秋呢？

90
00:05:52,48 --> 00:05:54,95
A couple of nurses asked them out.
可能跟約她們的護士在一起

91
00:05:55,65 --> 00:05:57,12
Really? Male nurses?
是嗎？男看護？ 

92
00:05:57,32 --> 00:05:59,31
Yeah,I was bummed too.
對，我也很失望

93
00:06:00,62 --> 00:06:02,49
So they're going on dates.
她們要去約會？

94
00:06:02,72 --> 00:06:05,39
-When? -I think Saturday.
什麼時候？星期六吧…

95
00:06:06,93 --> 00:06:09,56
-What's with him? -Sympathy pains.
他怎麼了？ 他感同身受

96
00:06:10,00 --> 00:06:14,33
It was sweet at first,but now I think he's trying to steal my thunder.
我本來很感動 現在我覺得他只是想搶鋒頭

97
00:06:17,27 --> 00:06:18,83
Let's see what we got here.
好，來看看你的情況

98
00:06:19,64 --> 00:06:22,67
Oh,you know,Fonzie dated triplets.
你知道嗎？ 方奇跟三胞胎約過會

99
00:06:24,35 --> 00:06:27,18
This Fonzie person you keep referring to...
你一直提到的這位方奇 ？

100
00:06:27,48 --> 00:06:29,51
...is that another doctor?
他是另一位醫生嗎

101
00:06:29,78 --> 00:06:30,81
Oh,no,no.
不是 

102
00:06:30,95 --> 00:06:33,75
Fonzie is the nickname of Arthur Fonzerelli.
方奇是亞瑟方塞瑞利的匿稱

103
00:06:35,16 --> 00:06:36,18
The Fonz.
也叫方子

104
00:06:38,96 --> 00:06:39,95
All right.
好

105
00:06:44,03 --> 00:06:46,30
It's not that weird,is it?
其實不會很怪吧？

106
00:06:46,77 --> 00:06:48,26
It's very weird!
怪得不得了

107
00:06:48,47 --> 00:06:53,13
I don't want some guy down there telling me I'm "dilated-a-mundo."
我才不要聽某人告訴我 我擴張了「一滴滴」

108
00:06:55,51 --> 00:06:58,34
He doesn't seem to be impersonating Fonzie
老實說，他不是在模仿方奇…

109
00:06:58,61 --> 00:06:59,71
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

110
00:07:01,15 --> 00:07:04,45
Why are you defending him? Just get me another doctor...
幹嘛替他辯解？去幫我另外找一個

112
00:07:04,65 --> 00:07:06,68
...who isn't crazy and doesn't Fonzie!
沒有發瘋 不是方奇的醫生

113
00:07:07,36 --> 00:07:08,45
Again,it's not
其實他不是…

114
00:07:16,06 --> 00:07:17,96
Hey,there you are!
你在這裡

115
00:07:18,47 --> 00:07:20,30
There's something you should know.
有件事應該讓你知道

116
00:07:20,50 --> 00:07:23,49
Is this about you dating the nurse? Joey told me.
是你要跟護士約會的事嗎？我聽喬伊說了

117
00:07:23,74 --> 00:07:27,20
I am so fine. You and l, we're just nothing.
我一點也不在意 你和我又沒什麼 

119
00:07:28,68 --> 00:07:30,04
Just goofing around.
我們只是玩玩

120
00:07:33,82 --> 00:07:36,75
I was about to tell you I was getting out of it.
其實我是想告訴你我打算推掉

121
00:07:37,02 --> 00:07:40,82
But if we're just "goofing around," maybe I will go out with him.
既然我們只是玩玩 那我就跟他出去好了

122
00:07:41,06 --> 00:07:43,15
Fine. Maybe I will too.
好，那我也要

123
00:07:45,59 --> 00:07:49,09
Hey! Look what I found in the gift shop.
喂，你們看我去禮品部…

124
00:07:49,43 --> 00:07:51,73
Get up! Get up! Get up!
起來，快起來

125
00:07:58,27 --> 00:07:59,86
This is Dr. Oberman.
菲比，這是歐伯曼醫生

126
00:08:00,37 --> 00:08:03,00
He has no strong feelings about Fonzie...
他對「幸福時光」的所有人物 

127
00:08:03,21 --> 00:08:06,34
...or any of the Happy Days gang.
都沒什麼感覺

128
00:08:07,38 --> 00:08:09,41
You're going into what grade?
你要升幾年級？

129
00:08:10,59 --> 00:08:14,11
I'm actually a first-year resident. I graduated early.
我剛升住院醫師 常有人那樣問我，我提前…

130
00:08:14,39 --> 00:08:15,72
Me too.
我也是

131
00:08:17,09 --> 00:08:20,39
I should have specified I'd need a grown-up doctor.
羅斯，或許我應該強調 我是要已成年的醫師

132
00:08:21,20 --> 00:08:22,79
Really,I'm fully qualified
我絕對有能力…

133
00:08:23,03 --> 00:08:24,05
Doogie!

134
00:08:26,63 --> 00:08:30,93
Doesn't anybody understand that I'm going to be having babies soon?
到底有沒有人瞭解我快生了？

135
00:08:31,64 --> 00:08:33,61
Go,little boy! Go!
你走，走啊 小毛頭

136
00:08:37,45 --> 00:08:39,78
Oh,cool. You made him cry!
你把他弄哭了

137
00:08:44,75 --> 00:08:49,09
Mr. Tribbiani,I'm afraid you've got kidney stones.
崔比亞尼先生，你有腎結石

138
00:08:49,89 --> 00:08:51,65
Well,what else could it be?
有別的可能嗎？ 

139
00:08:51,93 --> 00:08:53,89
It's kidney stones.
就是腎結石

140
00:08:54,90 --> 00:08:55,89
Or....
或是…？ 

141
00:08:56,10 --> 00:08:57,72
Kidney stones.
腎結石

142
00:08:59,97 --> 00:09:03,80
-lf it was something else? -Well,that would be "kidney stones."
如果是別的毛病… 絕對是腎結石

143
00:09:08,11 --> 00:09:09,44
You're getting there.
差不多了

144
00:09:09,64 --> 00:09:11,87
These babies are very,very lucky.
這些寶寶很幸運 

145
00:09:12,11 --> 00:09:13,17
They are? Why?
是嗎，為什麼？

146
00:09:13,38 --> 00:09:16,48
They'll be born on the Fonz's half-birthday.
他們的生日日期是方子的一半

147
00:09:18,99 --> 00:09:20,61
Happy Birthday.
生日快樂

148
00:09:21,16 --> 00:09:23,12
Just to clarify...
我澄清一下，

149
00:09:23,32 --> 00:09:24,99
...I'm not Fonzie.
我不是方奇

150
00:09:33,80 --> 00:09:38,14
It's a terrific thing that you're having these babies for Frank and Alice.
說真的 你能替你弟生孩子真的很棒

151
00:09:38,34 --> 00:09:40,00
No,it is.
的確

152
00:09:40,88 --> 00:09:42,71
Can I tell you a secret?
我可以告訴你一個秘密嗎？ 你說

153
00:09:43,74 --> 00:09:45,64
I want to keep one.
我要自己留一個

154
00:09:50,55 --> 00:09:52,52
Oh,I'm gonna be on the news.
天哪，我會上新聞

155
00:09:54,76 --> 00:09:56,02
You must be kidding.
菲比，別開玩笑了 

156
00:09:56,26 --> 00:09:58,89
You know you can't keep one of these babies.
你明知你不能這麼做

157
00:09:59,09 --> 00:10:01,08
Maybe I can. You don't know.
為什麼？搞不好可以 你怎麼知道

158
00:10:01,30 --> 00:10:05,32
I do. Frank and Alice will want to keep all their children.
我當然知道 法蘭克他們一定三個都要

159
00:10:05,53 --> 00:10:07,97
Maybe not. You know?
不一定

160
00:10:08,47 --> 00:10:10,49
Three babies are a handful.
三個寶寶很多 

161
00:10:10,71 --> 00:10:12,97
Maybe they'll want to unload one.
也許他們正在找機會送走一個

162
00:10:14,68 --> 00:10:18,70
I hate to miss an opportunity because I didn't ask.
我不想因為沒開口而失去機會

163
00:10:20,98 --> 00:10:23,11
Phoebe,no. This is insane.
菲比，這件事太扯了

164
00:10:23,32 --> 00:10:24,44
Just ask him.
你就問問看嘛 

165
00:10:24,65 --> 00:10:26,35
What? Me?
我？

166
00:10:26,82 --> 00:10:27,81
I can't ask him!
我不能自己問 

167
00:10:28,06 --> 00:10:31,39
Do you know how inappropriate that would be?
你知道那樣多不成體統嗎？

168
00:10:32,73 --> 00:10:35,22
All I'm saying is, just talk to Frank.
總之你去找法蘭克談 

169
00:10:35,43 --> 00:10:36,76
Just feel him out.
探探他的口風

170
00:10:36,96 --> 00:10:40,56
No. I will not ask Frank to give you one of his kids.
不行，我怎麼能叫法蘭克 送你一個孩子

171
00:10:42,47 --> 00:10:43,49
You're right.
你說得對

172
00:10:49,08 --> 00:10:50,98
Tell him it's for you.
就說是你要的

173
00:10:53,35 --> 00:10:54,94
Feeling better,sweetie?
好一點了嗎？ 

174
00:10:55,18 --> 00:10:56,91
Maybe a little.
一點點吧

175
00:10:57,12 --> 00:10:58,92
Wish you hadn't seen me throw up.
真希望你沒看到我吐

176
00:11:00,45 --> 00:11:01,68
Me too.
我也希望

177
00:11:04,83 --> 00:11:06,29
I just heard. What's up?
我剛剛聽說，怎麼回事？ 

178
00:11:06,49 --> 00:11:08,36
Kidney stones!
腎結石

179
00:11:11,63 --> 00:11:15,63
Ordinarily,we try to break the stones up with shock waves.
通常我們會用衝擊波震碎結石 

180
00:11:15,84 --> 00:11:18,24
But they're too close to the bladder.
但你的結石已經太靠近膀胱

181
00:11:18,44 --> 00:11:22,47
Either we wait for you to pass them or else go up the urethra
不是等你排尿排出來 就是從尿道往上…

182
00:11:25,68 --> 00:11:28,84
No,no,no,no. Nothing is going up,okay?
不行，不能往上 絕對不考慮往上

183
